# An action executes a read/write composite Value Operation that copies its view into a local view with a View Setting Statement, so its function copies the value before the Encoding Operation writes the view.
define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/test> {
    it also assigns the position</final_result>.
    it happens when {
        this particle is created.
    } and it does {
        create a particle in position</final_result>.
        set the value of position</final_result> from literal<standard:/number>"21".
        execute the operation</negate_in_place> {
            with view<value> looking at position</final_result>.
        }
    }
}
